{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55627","headline":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 二十五 · 延寿","name":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 二十五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"巨浸层峦本自平，只缘人世强分明。\n五侯门外悲欢意，长乐坡头去住情。\n学道不如忘有念，修身争是了无生。\n三祗功业犹难及，谁信尘劳直下明。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"延寿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55627.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55627","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}